{{!-- META {"path":"search","title":"Site search","description":"Full-text search over every page, from a static index the build writes next to the sitemap. No search server and no third party: the box below searches this site.","parent":"showcase","order":7,"data":{"icon":"magnifying-glass","preset":"flow-field"}} --}}
{{> page-hero parent=page.parent}}

<section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-16 sm:py-24">
  <div class="max-w-3xl" data-sw-animation="fade-up">
    <p class="ws-index ws-ink">01 · One helper</p>
    <h2 class="ws-display mt-3 text-3xl font-bold sm:text-5xl" data-sw-text="s1_title">Search this site.</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-base-content/70" data-sw-text="s1_lead">The helper writes the input, the results list and the empty state. It searches as you type and fetches the index on first use. Try "deploy", "carousel" or a quoted phrase such as "static files".</p>
  </div>
  <div class="mt-10 rounded-3xl border border-base-content/10 bg-base-100 p-6 sm:p-10">
<!--demo:helper-->
{{sw-search placeholder="Search this site…" limit=8 class="mx-auto max-w-2xl [&_input]:w-full"}}
<!--/demo-->
  </div>
  <div class="mt-6">
<!--code:helper file="search · helper"-->
  </div>
</section>

<section class="border-y border-base-content/10 bg-base-200/50">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-16 sm:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-3xl" data-sw-animation="fade-up">
      <p class="ws-index ws-ink">02 · Your own layout</p>
      <h2 class="ws-display mt-3 text-3xl font-bold sm:text-5xl" data-sw-text="s2_title">Write the parts, keep every class.</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-base-content/70" data-sw-text="s2_lead">Hand-write the input, the results container and the empty message when you need the layout. The runtime only fills the results container with links you can style through their <code class="font-code text-base">sw-search-hit</code> classes. <code class="font-code text-base">data-sw-limit</code> caps the list; here, at four.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-start">
      <div class="rounded-3xl border border-base-content/10 bg-base-100 p-6">
<!--demo:own-->
<div data-sw-component="search" data-sw-limit="4">
  <input data-sw-part="input" type="search" class="w-full" aria-label="Search the documentation" placeholder="Search the documentation" autocomplete="off" />
  <div data-sw-part="results" class="mt-3 [&_.sw-search-hit-title]:font-heading"></div>
  <p data-sw-part="empty" hidden class="mt-3 text-sm text-base-content/60">Nothing matched. Try fewer words.</p>
</div>
<!--/demo-->
      </div>
      <div class="min-w-0">
<!--code:own file="search · own layout"-->
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-16 sm:py-24">
  <div class="max-w-3xl" data-sw-animation="fade-up">
    <p class="ws-index ws-ink">What gets searched</p>
    <h2 class="ws-display mt-3 text-3xl font-bold sm:text-4xl" data-sw-text="s3_title">Pages, ranked.</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
    <div class="rounded-3xl border border-base-content/10 bg-base-100 p-6" data-sw-animation="fade-up">
      {{sw-icon "article" "h-6 w-6 ws-ink"}}
      <h3 class="mt-4 font-heading text-lg font-bold">Whole pages</h3>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-base-content/70">Every word of a page body, plus its title, description and headings, which weigh more. The navigation and footer are left out, or every page would match every menu word.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-3xl border border-base-content/10 bg-base-100 p-6" data-sw-animation="fade-up" data-sw-delay="60">
      {{sw-icon "sort-descending" "h-6 w-6 ws-ink"}}
      <h3 class="mt-4 font-heading text-lg font-bold">Ranked</h3>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-base-content/70">Pages that match all your words come first. Each hit shows the title, the description and a snippet with the match highlighted.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-3xl border border-base-content/10 bg-base-100 p-6" data-sw-animation="fade-up" data-sw-delay="120">
      {{sw-icon "translate" "h-6 w-6 ws-ink"}}
      <h3 class="mt-4 font-heading text-lg font-bold">One index per language</h3>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-base-content/70">The page's language picks the index, so a German page never lists English results.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-3xl border border-base-content/10 bg-base-100 p-6" data-sw-animation="fade-up" data-sw-delay="180">
      {{sw-icon "eye-slash" "h-6 w-6 ws-ink"}}
      <h3 class="mt-4 font-heading text-lg font-bold">Left out</h3>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-base-content/70">Pages hidden from search engines, menu-only link pages and raw imported pages. Without JavaScript the box stays a plain input.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{{> showcase-next}}
